<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Petrobras cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Petrobras cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- SBC Warburg analyst Mary Quinn has reduced her rating on Brazilian state oil company Petroleo Brasileiro SA, or Petrobras, to a near-term hold from a near-term buy.</p>
<p>-- She wrote in an April 7 report that the downgrade was &quot;on the back of production bottlenecks.</p>
<p>-- &quot;We maintain our long-term buy recommendation based on some of the best oil fundamentals in the industry.&quot; Her 12-month target price for preferred shares is 255 reais.</p>
<p>-- Petrobras preferred shares were off 0.50 real to 209 reais in Sao Paulo.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
